<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- ================================================================
     ADAPTIVE LAUNCHER ICON - round 22, v0.9.7
     Variant "4g - Slice-scan A" (owner-approved).

     This file is wiring only. It names three layers and contains no art,
     no colours and no geometry, so a future icon revision touches the
     layer files and NOT this one.

     THE PIPELINE
       background  @color/ic_launcher_background   values/ic_launcher_background.xml
       foreground  @drawable/ic_launcher_foreground  (rings + slice-line A)
       monochrome  @drawable/ic_launcher_monochrome  (flat A, Android 13+ themed icons)

     HOW TO SWAP IN A NEW ICON (the one-change procedure)
       1. Export the new art as a 108x108 VectorDrawable. Keep everything
          that must always be legible within 33 units of the centre (54,54).
          The guaranteed-visible safe zone is a CIRCLE of diameter 66, not
          the 21..87 square - art can satisfy the square and still be sliced
          by a round mask at the corners, which is exactly what happened to
          this mark's feet. Deliberate bleed is fine for decoration such as
          the pulse rings.
       2. Overwrite drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml with it, keeping the
          FILENAME. Do not rename it and do not edit this file.
       3. Overwrite drawable/ic_launcher_monochrome.xml with the same mark
          flattened to one opaque colour - no gradients, no per-element
          opacity. The launcher re-tints it from the wallpaper palette.
       4. Re-tint the plate by editing the single <color> value in
          values/ic_launcher_background.xml. Nothing else hard-codes it.
       5. Move the file it replaced to *_legacy.xml rather than deleting it,
          matching drawable/ic_launcher_foreground_legacy.xml.
       6. Build :app:assembleDebug - AAPT2 validates VectorDrawable pathData
          at build time, so a malformed path fails the build rather than
          shipping as a blank icon.
     Steps 2-4 are the whole change; this file stays untouched.

     RETIRED, kept retrievable, referenced by nothing:
       drawable/ic_launcher_foreground_legacy.xml  (teal radar sweep)
       drawable/ic_launcher_background_legacy.xml  (solid #12181F vector)

     NOTE: minSdk is 29, so every supported device takes this anydpi-v26
     definition. There are no PNG mipmap-*dpi fallbacks in this project and
     none are needed.
     ================================================================ -->
<adaptive-icon xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <background android:drawable="@color/ic_launcher_background" />
    <foreground android:drawable="@drawable/ic_launcher_foreground" />
    <monochrome android:drawable="@drawable/ic_launcher_monochrome" />
</adaptive-icon>
